Static assets served from the site root.

A file here at `web/public/logo.png` is served at `/logo.png`.

Expected:
  logo.png     the square mark, the 3D render
  banner.png   the wide lockup, for social/OG cards

The flat SVG mark used in the nav and favicon is not here — it is a component
(components/ParleyMark.tsx) and app/icon.svg, because it takes its colour from
the theme and has to stay crisp at 16px.
